Parallel Stages:

Jenkins allows parallel execution of multiple stages to speed up pipelines.

Syntax:


    stage('Parallel Example') {
        parallel {
            stage('Unit Tests') {
                steps { sh 'pytest tests/unit' }
            }
            stage('Integration Tests') {
                steps { sh 'pytest tests/integration' }
            }
        }
    }

Useful for running independent tasks (tests, builds, linting) simultaneously.

